          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider a graph below. Cut-vertices in the graph are</p><pre class=\"mermaid\">graph TD\n  a --- b\n  b --- c\n  b --- d\n  c --- d\n  c --- e\n  e --- f\n  f --- g\n  g --- h\n  e --- h\n  e --- g</pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xét đồ thị dưới đây. Các đỉnh khớp (cut-vertex) trong đồ thị là</p><pre class=\"mermaid\">graph TD\n  a --- b\n  b --- c\n  b --- d\n  c --- d\n  c --- e\n  e --- f\n  f --- g\n  g --- h\n  e --- h\n  e --- g</pre></div>",
